 and everything.<br /> I am considering founding a bloodline, if I do their discipline reflects their nature as worms spinning webs of influence like conspiratorial spiders but their cause reflects my Physical dependence on others and mild paranoia<br /> Eventually my Terrible Flesh will reach the next stage and this worm will spin his cocoon, but what terrible bug will I hatch as?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is pretty detailed and ambitious!<br /> <br /> But as for what you will turn into.. maybe a Slenderman, I dunno. The things that come out of cocoons are never as obese as their larva stage after all","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T08:43:18-07:00","id":1128058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128049#post1128049\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That is pretty detailed and ambitious!<br /> <br /> But as for what you will turn into.. maybe a Slenderman, I dunno. The things that come out of cocoons are never as obese as their larva stage after all</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> A beautiful, blood sucking butterfly!<br /> <br /> Oh gods