c4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T12:02:17-07:00","id":1128116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128104#post1128104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was being satirical about the obese thing, but yeah that would be interesting, though being a gargantuan blood drinking worm in a space age seems even more problematic to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh ruling a planet provides plenty of blood, and my armies provide even more with their raids on other planets. Being a final boss is great as long as you take tarquin's viewpoint, I win I stay a great blood god, if I lose I become a legend to inspire future nosfertau to the heights I did, besides being a giant worm sounds fun to me, burrowing tunnels and whatnot. besides I can always have a thrall type for me","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 08-12-2017, 03:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T13:02:49-07:00","id":1128137,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128116#post1128116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh ruling a planet provides plenty of blood, and my armies provide even more with their raids on other planets. Being a final boss is great as long as you take tarquin's viewpoint, I win I stay a great blood god, if I lose I become a legend to inspire future nosfertau to the heights I did, besides being a giant worm sounds fun to me, burrowing tunnels and whatnot. besides I can always have a thrall type for me</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, but here's two problems: total population enslavement is sort of impossible. Giant worm or not, if this planet has billions of people, how are you gonna make enough blood to infect everyone?<br /> <br /> Two: what about the other vampires? Sure some could see the appeal, but others ( me for example) would kinda see such a huge size a bit of a liability. Why rule as a giant worm when you could of done it as a much smaller and much more easier protected grub thing? Maybe I'm biased, but media just doesn't portray being utterly gigantic all that of a boon that often lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 08-12-2017, 04:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T13:09:51-07:00","id":1128143,"title":"","content":"As a worm, you can eat and crap at the same time! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> And speaking of vampires and worms...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://img14.deviantart.net/f85a/i/2015/149/a/c/nosferatu___parasitic_infestation_by_z_grimv-d8o7di8.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> But seriously; why be a parasite, when you can be a predator?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://vignette2.wikia.nocookie.net/whitewolf/images/b/bd/NosferatuNoctuku.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20111222221711\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-12-2017, 04:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T13:27:45-07:00","id":1128155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128137#post1128137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay, but here's two problems: total population enslavement is sort of impossible. Giant worm or not, if this planet has billions of people, how are you gonna make enough blood to infect everyone?<br /> <br /> Two: what about the other vampires? Sure some could see the appeal, but others ( me for example) would kinda see such a huge size a bit of a liability. Why rule as a giant worm when you could of done it as a much smaller and much more easier protected grub thing? Maybe I'm biased, but media just doesn't portray being utterly gigantic all that of a boon that often lol</div> </div> </div> </div>Ehh, true, maybe just enslave the people in key positions and let them rule the rest, while set up a Worm Cult to carry out my will.<br /> <br /> and Media does an anti-kaiju bias<br /> <br /> Then again, the rules for the worm don't actually say it's ichor is made from blood, could be I just reach a state where vitae is not needed to make the bond, thus full population enslavement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 08-12-2017, 04:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T14:15:20-07:00","id":1128181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128155#post1128155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ehh, true, maybe just enslave the people in key positions and let them rule the rest, while set up a Worm Cult to carry out my will.<br /> <br /> and Media does an anti-kaiju bias<br /> <br /> Then again, the rules for the worm don't actually say it's ichor is made from blood, could be I just reach a state where vitae is not needed to make the bond, thus full population enslavement.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well yeah, giant monsters who aren't Ultraman or Godzilla are assholes.<br /> <br /> I dunno, you're still Kindred, even Methuselah use vitae and the like to do things despite the thousands of years of existence. I doubt a simple Devotion would turn you into something that breaks away from your vampiric state so dramatically. <br /> <br /> Even if the ichor isn't blood, it would probably cost vitae to generate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-12T14:31:44-07:00","id":1128191,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128181#post1128181\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well yeah, giant monsters who aren't Ultraman or Godzilla are assholes.<br /> <br /> I dunno, you're still Kindred, even Methuselah use vitae and the like to do things despite the thousands of years of existence. I doubt a simple Devotion would turn you into something that breaks away from your vampiric state so dramatically.<br /> <br /> Even if the ichor isn't blood, it would probably cost vitae to generate.</div> </div> </div> </div>True. Still, guess the Worm Cult plus enslaved human puppet leaders way would be the one to go with.<br /> <br /> But enough about me, I want to see more forum elders","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 08-12-2017, 05:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T10:34:02-07:00","id":1128506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128191#post1128191\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> True. Still, guess the Worm Cult plus enslaved human puppet leaders way would be the one to go with.<br /> <br /> But enough about me, I want to see more forum elders</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if I somehow did make it to that ripe old age..<br /> How to put this..<br /> The weaponized version of a cool uncle? The elder that all the neonates look up to, and so are easy prey, scapegoats, and allies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8fsIR2T.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13566-kalzky","name":"Kalzky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13566_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T11:33:38-07:00","id":1128522,"title":"","content":"With my history of mental illness, i'd probably be Ventrue.<br /> <br /> As for Covenant... you know what? I could be all noble and self-sacrificing and all that shit, I could follow my mortal, socialist ideals and compassion, but if i'm going to be turned into a hideous abomination for all eternity I'm going to make bank. Invictus. Hookers and blow and mind control.<br /> <br /> Fuck you.<br /> <br /> Got mine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T15:57:32-07:00","id":1128602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kalzky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128506#post1128506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, if I somehow did make it to that ripe old age..<br /> How to put this..<br /> The weaponized version of a cool uncle? The elder that all the neonates look up to, and so are easy prey, scapegoats, and allies.</div> </div> </div> </div>Vampire Uncle Grandpa?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T18:59:01-07:00","id":1128665,"title":"","content":"I haven't put a lot of thought into reaching elder years in humanity's future.<br /> <br /> Something to put some thought into.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T19:34:52-07:00","id":1128676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kalzky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128506#post1128506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, if I somehow did make it to that ripe old age..<br /> How to put this..<br /> The weaponized version of a cool uncle? The elder that all the neonates look up to, and so are easy prey, scapegoats, and allies.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That is, until word gets out you have a tendency to throw people under a bus for your own convenience... then you're the manipulative ass hole the ancillae warn each other about.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Edit:</b> That being said, I'm a man of simple pleasures, and I'm also extremely fickle. Most of the time, I want something only because I don't have it, and then I quickly grow bored within a couple months.<br /> <br /> <br /> As an elder Unaligned, I'd probably be a social recluse. I'd be a monster, but I'd keep mostly to myself; unless somebody tried to start shit with me unprovoked. At which point, I'd employ a &quot;scorched earth&quot; policy to remind them not to do that again.<br /> <br /> <br /> As an elder of the Circle, I'd probably have established myself as some kind of blood god, replete with a cult (i.e harem) of worshipers with which to host bi-weekly (nightly?) blood orgies while stroking my ego... among other things. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 08-14-2017, 04:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-13T22:49:59-07:00","id":1128717,"title":"","content":"Well, if I made it to elder status then I figure I'll write up a full thing now.<br /> <br /> Clan: As much as I like Ventrue and Nosferatu, I am neither domineering enough or scary enough to be either. However, I am very good at not being seen and I love to do research, so I'd probably end up becoming a Mekhet.<br /> <br /> Bloodline: Hopefully I'd become a Neglatu; the chance to make someone else's life easier when they went through the hell of being a Revenant would make me a happier man.<br /> <br /> Covenant: It really depends, honestly. I wanna say the Ordo Dracul, but I dunno. Just seeking transcendence sounds aimless, and I'd want a purpose beyond that. I don't think I'd fit in either the Sanctum or Circle either; I wouldn't be interested in the Sanctum's mission and I don't think I could stomach the Circle. So let's go with what I would be in either the Invictus or Carthian Movement.<br /> <br /> If I was in the Invictus I think I would be pretty damn happy as a Notary. I like to peer over contracts, and the Invictus' purpose of keeping the Masquerade would give me something to do from night to night.<br /> <br /> If I joined the Carthian Movement then I would probably try to be the guy people could go to for some help for help when it comes to hiding from the other covenants. I'd try to have hidey holes all over the city, and I'd try to be on good terms with the Nosferatu.<br /> <br /> Anyway, that's my take on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","user":"Ever Professional","date":". 08-14-2017, 01:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T01:23:59-07:00","id":1128731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ever Professional</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128717#post1128717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Clan: As much as I like Ventrue and Nosferatu, I am neither domineering enough or scary enough to be either.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Nosferatu have probably the most liberal screening process for their embraces. You don't have to be a scary person (that comes later), you just have to either <b>A)</b> have a particular set of skills, talents, resources or attributes they consider valuable to the clan; or you can <b>B)</b> be a big enough ass hole that they feel you need to be punished.<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Anybody</i> can be a Nosferatu. That's probably why they're considered the bottom feeders.<br /> <br /> Gangrel, Ventrue, Daeva and Mekhet hold themselves to a higher standard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T01:26:19-07:00","id":1128733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1121995-you-as-a-vampire?p=1128731#post1128731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Nosferatu have probably the most liberal screening process for their embraces. You don't have to be a scary person (that comes later), you just have to either <b>A)</b> have a particular set of skills, talents, resources or attributes they consider valuable to the clan; or you can <b>B)</b> be a big enough ass hole that they feel you need to be punished.<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>Anybody</i> can be a Nosferatu. That's probably why they're considered the bottom feeders.<br /> <br /> Gangrel, Ventrue, Daeva and Mekhet have higher standards.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then I'd be either a Nosferatu or Mekhet. I could go either way really.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T02:28:38-07:00","id":1128738,"title":"","content":"If I should somehow manage to become a Ventrue Elder in the Invictus, I would probably work mostly through catpaws since I would have attained a large number of allies and power. I would, however, reward the Neonates and Ancillae in my servies appropriately (at least, the way I see it), and also start my own dynasty. The true purpose of many of the jobs I would be handing out would be to figure out who is worthy of joining it.<br /> <br /> Going the Ordo Dracul Gangrel route, I would certainly have become a rather formidable and resilient force - I might even be working on my very own Coils or Scales. I would probably be a Sort of new Beckett, traveling from city to city, place to place, in search of new knowledge. Sometimes, I would stay longer, in order to do some more in-depth experiments. It would be a pretty relaxed life, by Kindred standards.<br /> <br /> Should I somehow have ended up Ventrue Ordo, I would definetly pick up the Voivode Coils, and I am sure after hundreds of years with powers like that, I would end up an enormous, manipulative, impatient asshole with a mean streak and a bad attitude. I would either tyrannize the City or be the reason the reast unifies. When they finally try to topple me, I would make myself rare and disappear, being hard to find due to having worked through catspaws. Next city, I would aim to be the mastermind pulling the strings in the background again.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T08:25:03-07:00","id":1128837,"title":"","content":"I think we can say we've all learned about ourselves, since coming here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-14T12:56:44-07:00","id":1128930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode